      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آذَارُ</span></b>  <i>The sixth of the Greek</i> [or <i>Syrian] months
[corresponding to March O. S.</i>]. (K.) [This
is not to be confounded with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آذَرْ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آذُرْ</span>, which
